ドゥス（世界の資格者）」の一人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13905","sourceWorkId":"3497","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エリム王国の王女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人の運命を幻視の形で知ることのできる彼女は、人々からは《イシュハラの聖女》と讃えられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の婚約者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「もう、暗闇に閉ざされた明日を嘆くだけではいません。　運命は絶対ではない……。　わたくしは自らの意思で選んだ、バアル様と共にある道を行きます」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"146187"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/adb616a0d1cb13af4d4f320a870a545297821a7989274a51bad4e6ba29fa6455.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/16/160b824f22b934e65e91c0f793ae0eea4e64eaaa7b57babd5b0ba512841df209.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:305912:146187:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c35595","characterName":"カルラ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"146188","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"305912"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13906"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35595"},"originalCharacterName":"カルラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"太古の亜人「ニンツ」の末裔。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"始源の魂を解放するもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"滅びた同胞の復讐を果たすため、創世の秘術「アルスマグナ」を探している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13906","sourceWorkId":"3497","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"エリム王国の宮廷占術師。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優れた力を持つ古代の種族《ニンツ》の生き残り。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"滅びた同胞の復讐を果たす為、創世の秘術《アルスマグナ》を探し求めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「それにしてもまぁ、カメの動きのような神経の鈍さだこと……。　本当なら、あなただけは、この場に来る前に動けなくなっていたはずなのにさ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"146188"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/7699dae985117a1575f61c45019848e80c629f2e29ae86a4c2d280c572af858c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/98c8972ab1dc91b64c811abbfacf40303ce528a62b45220a6ef54b34219e29e0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:305912:146188:4832:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c35599","characterName":"ギルス","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"146189","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"305912"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13910"],"vndbCharacterId":"c35599"},"originalCharacterName":"ギルス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ラルス王国の王女で戦士団長。バアルの義姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"独自の双剣術を操る達人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「イリアドゥス】（世界の資格者）」の一人。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13910","sourceWorkId":"3497","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ラルス王国の王女で戦士団長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛用の武器「イガリマ（緑の刃）」と「シュルシャガナ（赤の刃）」という、二振りの小剣を携え独自の双剣術を操る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"熱しやすく、キレやすく、喧嘩っ早いのが玉にキズ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"バアルの義姉にあたる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「アンタの考えとることなんか、昔からお姉様はみーんな、お見通しや」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"146189"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/ch